ZVSE2

** EYE OF PROVIDENCE - part that must run BEFORE the Advanced Classes Mod scripts
**
** Scouting events: on every step, the Advanced Classes Mod subtracts the hero's
** "ACM_Reward_Scouting_Chance" points from its event roll range (fewer points = rarer events).
** For a hero with the Eye of Providence, add EOP_PRE_EVENT_CHANCE points here, just before ACM reads
** them; "-2000 eye of providence.erm" takes them back after ACM's movement handler.

!#DC(EOP_PRE_OPTION)        = 955;       [shared option "Custom Artifacts"]
!#DC(EOP_PRE_ART)           = 283;
!#DC(EOP_PRE_EVENT_CHANCE)  = 150;

!?HM-1;
!!VRi^eop_addedPoints^:S0;
!!UN:P(EOP_PRE_OPTION)/?(enabled:y);
!!FU|(enabled)<>1/i^cr_hasResound^<>(TRUE)/i^cr_hasACM^<>(TRUE):E;

!!HE-1:N?(hero:y);
!!HE(hero):A2/(EOP_PRE_ART)/?(count:y)/?(equipped:y);
!!FU&(equipped)<=0:E;

!!SN:W^ACM_Reward_Scouting_Chance_%(hero)^/?(points:y);
!!VR(points):+(EOP_PRE_EVENT_CHANCE);
!!SN:W^ACM_Reward_Scouting_Chance_%(hero)^/(points);
!!VRi^eop_addedPoints^:S(EOP_PRE_EVENT_CHANCE);
